# Station (live server): buy and sell at room 2's second vendor (Miyoshi Basho), from the user's recording of
# 2026-11-15 (.work/e2e/202650-record: buying at Vila Mosj 58-106 s, selling at Miyoshi Basho 259-278 s). A
# vendor's talk tree's Trade reply opens the vendor list (right) and the cargo (left); a vendor row and Buy sends
# INVENTORY_MOVE, a cargo slot and Sell sends INVENTORY_MOVE. Vila Mosj refuses to buy back what she sells (the
# server's MESSAGE_STRING, 'Vendor does not want this item!'), so both are done at Miyoshi Basho: one Mi MXM
# Warhead (164 credits) bought, then one sold. Ammunition stacks, so the warheads stay in one cargo slot whatever
# a failed run left there.
name: starbase vendor: buy and sell
timeout: 400
include _sb_home
# room 1: the door to room 2 at -44,-58
walk-to -44,-38
face -90 tol 5
hold 0x41 until msg 'Changing room from 1 to 2' within 15
# room 2: to Miyoshi Basho's counter (this approach from the door puts her right of the avatar)
walk-to 2,52
walk-to 23,27
walk-to 28.2,32.0
face 50
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
pose
click 1005,400 until antprox 'sent TALK_TREE' every 2 within 20
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
# the reply that opens trade
click 438,887
wait-event antprox 'sent ITEM_BASE' within 20
wait-event proxy 'fa_ce02a\.ini' within 40
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
# buy: the vendor list's first row (Mi MXM Warhead), then Buy (Buy Stack beside it buys 240)
click 1060,440
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
click 987,960
expect-event antprox 'received INVENTORY_MOVE' within 15
wait-event antprox 'sent AUX_DATA' within 15
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
shot bought
# sell: the warheads are in the cargo's first free slot (column 1, row 4 with this character's cargo: the credit
# chip and two stacks of 50 ahead of it), then Sell (one; Sell All below it takes the stack); the client asks 'You
# will take significant losses on this sale. Do you wish to proceed?' (Yes / No), Yes sends INVENTORY_MOVE and the
# server answers with MESSAGE_STRING and 'You have gained N credits'. One bought, one sold: the stack keeps its count
click 60,680
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
click 112,776
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
shot sell_confirm
click 486,561 until antprox 'received INVENTORY_MOVE' every 2 within 15
wait-event antprox 'sent MESSAGE_STRING' within 15
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
shot sold
# the vendor list's close box, then the talk window's Done
click gadget trade.close
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
click gadget talk.done until antprox 'sent TALK_TREE_ACTION' every 2 within 20
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
# back: room 2's door at 0,72, then home
walk-to 23,27
walk-to 2,52
walk-to 0,62
face 90 tol 5
hold 0x41 until msg 'Changing room from 2 to 1' within 15
walk-to -44,-38
walk-to -48,5
